    {"What to show beyond the image edge when Crop to Distortion is off: black, stretched edge or mirrored.", "关闭按畸变裁切后，图像边缘外的显示方式：黑色、拉伸边缘或镜像。"},
    {"When enabled, compensates light lost by taking-filters. Disable it when color filters should also darken the image like real exposure loss.", "启用时补偿摄影滤镜损失的光量。若希望滤色镜像真实曝光损失那样压暗画面，请关闭。"},
    {"Where an 18% grey is assumed in the incoming scan when timing the print. Auto follows the input: Cineon uses code 470, ADX uses 445. Spektra Stock times each channel on the grey of the stock selected under Film; use it when the scan comes from a Spektra Scan Negative node left on Spektra Stock, and pick the same stock here. It gives the closest match to one node; a fixed code matches brightness but can leave a colour cast.", "给印片配光时假定输入扫描中 18% 灰的位置。自动跟随输入：Cineon 用编码 470，ADX 用 445。Spektra Stock 按胶片参数中所选胶片的灰逐通道配光；当扫描来自保持 Spektra Stock 的 Spektra Scan Negative 节点时用它，并在此选择同一胶片。它最接近单节点效果；固定编码只匹配亮度，可能留下偏色。"},
    {"Where an 18% grey lands in the scanned negative. Auto follows the output: Cineon uses code 470, ADX and Positive Output use 445, Display Scan keeps the stock's own grey. Spektra Stock leaves the negative at its native density. The reference is reached by shifting film exposure, so film base stays at code 95, and it holds under film gamma and profile calibration. Push/pull, bleach bypass, dye fading, Capture EI and auto exposure move grey off it, as on a real negative. For a second Spektra node, use Spektra Stock on both. Colour negative stocks only.", "18% 灰在扫描负片中的位置。自动跟随输出：Cineon 用编码 470，ADX 与正片输出用 445，Display Scan 保留胶片自身的灰。Spektra Stock 让负片保持原生密度。参考值靠移动胶片曝光达到，因此片基固定在编码 95，且在胶片伽马与特性校准下保持不变。推冲/拉冲、漂白旁路、染料褪色、Capture EI 与自动曝光会使灰偏离该点，与真实负片一致。若使用第二个 Spektra 节点，两处都用 Spektra Stock。仅限彩色负片。"},
    {"Where in the frame the aberration starts.", "色差在画面中的起始位置。"},
    {"Where the IR filter cuts off. Higher values let more deep red through.", "IR 滤镜的截止位置。数值越高，通过的深红越多。"},
    {"Where the Petzval swirl begins.", "Petzval 旋涡起始位置。"},
    {"Where the UV filter cuts off. Lower values let more violet through.", "UV 滤镜的截止位置。数值越低，通过的紫色越多。"},
    {"Where the cat-eye clipping begins, shared with Bokeh.", "猫眼裁切起始位置，与散景共用。"},
    {"Where the defocus starts growing toward the edge.", "离焦开始向边缘增长的位置。"},
    {"Where the dirt sits: in the camera gate (fixed in frame), on the film (moves with it), or in the scanner (fixed to the output).", "脏点位置：摄影机片门（画面内固定）、胶片上（随胶片移动）或扫描仪（相对输出固定）。"},
    {"Where the flicker happens: camera, printer, scanner/projector, or all of them. Printer isn't available in Negative only.", "闪烁发生的位置：摄影机、印片机、扫描仪／放映机或全部。仅负片模式下印片机不可用。"},
    {"Where the mechanical darkening begins.", "机械压暗的起始位置。"},
    {"Which print stock's measured sharpness to use. Match Print Stock follows the selected print stock.", "使用哪种印片胶片的实测锐度。匹配印片胶片则跟随所选印片。"},
    {"Which stock's measured sharpness to use. Match Film Stock uses the selected stock, or the closest measured one.", "使用哪种胶片的实测锐度。匹配胶片类型用所选胶片或最接近者。"},
